    <briefdescription>
<para>RS@k aggregation over all interactions in a relay. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Mirrors the DELEGATE-52 evaluation protocol where RS is sampled at interaction indices k = 1, 5, 10, 20 (two-sided: forward = odd, backward = even in the raw interaction sequence).</para>
<para>In ThemisDB&apos;s model each element of <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1delegate__eval_1_1_reconstruction_score_at_k_1a2ae3295c3b9f1032698a1c3078bdd534" kindref="member">rs_per_interaction</ref></computeroutput> stores the RS against the original seed <emphasis>after</emphasis> that numbered interaction (1-based). So <computeroutput>rs_at(k)</computeroutput> simply retrieves element [k-1] when <computeroutput>k ≤ size</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
